    <li><a href={CHART} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Implementation Chart of the e-APP, including the list of e-Registers (HCCH, PDF)</a></li>
    <li><a href={ABC} target="_blank" rel="noopener">The ABCs of Apostilles, Question 12 (HCCH, PDF)</a></li>
    <li><a href={HB} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apostille Handbook, second edition 2023, paragraphs 267 to 281 (HCCH, PDF)</a></li>
    <li><a href={SECTION} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apostille Section (HCCH)</a></li>
    <li><a href={US_AUTH} target="_blank" rel="noopener">United States of America, Competent Authorities (HCCH)</a></li>
  </ul>
</Base>
